{
  "samples": [
    {
      "name": "benign/inbound-accept-ephemeral-hits-mining-port",
      "label": "benign",
      "data_type": 3002,
      "fields": {
        "event_type": "tcp_accept",
        "comm": "nginx",
        "exe": "/usr/sbin/nginx",
        "local_addr": "192.0.2.10",
        "local_port": "80",
        "remote_addr": "198.51.100.30",
        "remote_port": "3333",
        "protocol": "tcp"
      },
      "note": "prod 实例：nginx 在 80 端口接受连接，客户端临时源端口恰为 3333。挖矿矿池规则据此判 critical，挂了两个月（alerts#5726）。入站事件的 remote_port 是对端临时端口，不含任何语义。"
    },
    {
      "name": "benign/inbound-accept-ephemeral-hits-backdoor-port",
      "label": "benign",
      "data_type": 3002,
      "fields": {
        "event_type": "tcp_accept",
        "comm": "java",
        "exe": "/opt/jdk1.8/bin/java",
        "local_addr": "192.0.2.11",
        "local_port": "8080",
        "remote_addr": "198.51.100.31",
        "remote_port": "4444",
        "protocol": "tcp"
      },
      "note": "同一错误的另一形态：入站连接的临时源端口落在后门端口号上。"
    },
    {
      "name": "benign/inbound-accept-ephemeral-hits-tor-port",
